#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compare pre-defined service role actions {#compare-pre-defined-service-role-"
"actions}"
msgstr ""
"Comparar acciones predefinidas de roles de servicio {#compare-pre-defined-"
"service-role-actions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following table displays examples of actions that can be taken by the "
"pre-defined service role actions: Manager, Writer, and Reader. To see a "
"complete mapping of Quantum Service roles to actions, visit [this "
"table](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-service-roles-"
"actions#quantum-computing-roles) in the IBM Cloud Product guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"La siguiente tabla muestra ejemplos de acciones que pueden realizarse "
"mediante las acciones predefinidas de roles de servicio: Manager, Writer y "
"Reader. Para ver un mapeo completo de los roles del Servicio Quantum a "
"acciones, visita [esta "
"tabla](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-service-roles-"
"actions#quantum-computing-roles) en la guía del producto de IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Action | Description | Roles |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.session.create` | Create a Session/Batch | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.create` | Submit a Job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.read` | Read a result | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.cancel` | Cancel a job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.delete` | Delete a job | Manager |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Read QPU calibrations | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.account-analytics-usage.read` | See account analytics | Manager, Writer (*Only if role is set up for all resources*) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.instance-usage.read` | See instance usage and remaining time | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Acción | Descripción | Roles |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.session.create` | Crear una Session/Batch | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.create` | Enviar un Job (Trabajo) | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.read` | Leer un result (resultado) | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.cancel` | Cancelar un job | Manager, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.job.delete` | Eliminar un job | Manager |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Leer calibraciones de la QPU | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.account-analytics-usage.read` | Ver analíticas de cuenta | Manager, Writer (*Solo si el rol está configurado para todos los recursos*) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.instance-usage.read` | Ver uso de la instancia y tiempo restante | Manager, Reader, Writer |\n"

