#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Siguientes pasos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   - Understand the [IBM Cloud account structure](/guides/cloud-account-structure), including access policies, groups, and roles.\n"
"   - Read about [how IBM Cloud IAM works](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview).\n"
"   - Read more about how to [set up access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui).\n"
"   - Understand the the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) (select Qiskit Runtime from the dropdown at the top of the page).\n"
"   - Learn about [creating custom roles](/guides/custom-roles).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"   - Comprende la [estructura de cuentas de IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-account-structure), incluyendo políticas de acceso, grupos y roles.\n"
"   - Lee sobre [cómo funciona IBM Cloud IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview).\n"
"   - Lee más sobre cómo [configurar grupos de acceso](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui).\n"
"   - Comprende los [Roles IAM](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) (selecciona Qiskit Runtime en el menú desplegable en la parte superior de la página).\n"
"   - Aprende sobre la [creación de roles personalizados](/guides/custom-roles).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
